  "historyNote": "#6942, eff 2-1-99; ss by #8800, INTERIM, eff 2-1-07, EXPIRED: 7-31-07 New. #8959, eff 8-7-07; ss by #10983, eff 11-24-15; ss by #12930, eff 11-26-19; ss by #14325, eff 7-19-25, EXPIRES: 7-19-35",
  "inScheme": "https://granitestate.github.io/rules/scheme",
